  {
   "key": "scene_01",
   "text": "Enzo Maresca sits in the seat Pep Guardiola held for ten years. Before Fulham arrive at the Etihad, he says something plain. Yahoo Sports reports his words. \"We are conceding too many goals. Most of them are avoidable.\" A new era, a new coach, and a problem he has named himself. The match ends 1-1. But a draw hides the real question. Can Maresca stop his team giving goals away?",
