  {
   "key": "scene_03",
   "text": "Three people carry this story. The first is Enzo Maresca. He was Guardiola's assistant in 2022-23, and he took over on 29 June 2026. Sky Sports reports his promise: to do \"my job, in the way I want\". The second is Erling Haaland, alone at the top of City's 4-2-3-1. If City are to fix their night, he is the man who must score. The third is Oscar Bobb. A City academy graduate, he lines up on Fulham's right wing against his old club, as Sports Mole's preview expected. Remember his name. He matters before the half hour.",
