   "key": "scene_04",
   "text": "Etihad Stadium. Minute 7. Haaland shoots, blocked. Minute 8, O'Reilly shoots, blocked. Minute 9, a Dias header from a corner goes wide. Minute 16. Fulham answer, with their first shot. Oscar Bobb makes the pass, and Rodrigo Muniz scores with his right foot, in open play. 0-1. FotMob's momentum graph has City on top for 60 percent of the first half. Yet at half-time, it is 0-1. City dominate, and they trail.",
