   "key": "scene_05",
   "text": "The turning point is a miss. Minute 24. Haaland shoots with his left foot, very close to goal, down the middle. Saved. Expected goals, or xG, is learned from many past shots: distance, angle, foot or head, and the kind of pass. It tells you how often a shot like that goes in. FotMob rates this one the best chance of the match, for either team. Haaland ends with 4 shots worth 1.03 xG in total, and no goal.",
