   "key": "scene_06",
   "text": "Just before the hour, City finally score. From a corner, Elliot Anderson hits a right-footed shot from the edge of the area. AP calls it a stunning volley. 1-1. Then both benches move at minute 70. City bring on Rayan Cherki for Phil Foden; Fulham change two players. FotMob's momentum had City on top for 80 percent of the 15 minutes before, and 27 percent of the 15 after. Both sides changed, so the numbers cannot split the cause. The match tilts toward Fulham, and City never find a second goal.",
